  "detail_url": "https://api.sam.gov/prod/opportunities/v1/noticedesc?noticeid=b0a3fe9c412e4dec9f9c10e76788e6ad",
  "detail_text": "This synopsis is to announce that MICC-Fort Carson intends to award sole source firm fixed-price contract to Sheffield Company LLC. using Acquisition of Commercial Products and Commercial Services, FAR 12.201-1. THIS NOTICE IS NOT A REQUEST FOR COMPETITIVE PROPOSALS and a solicitation will not be issued. Interested concerns must show clear and convincing evidence that competition of this requirement would be advantageous to the Government. If no affirmative written responses are received by 24 March 2026, the award will be made without further notice. Oral communications are not acceptable in response to this notice. A determination by the government not to compete this proposed requirement is solely within the discretion of the government.",
